        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-35" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="580" y="420" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-43" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scientific Verification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#996185;fontSize=8;fillColor=#E6D0DE;gradientColor=#D5739D;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-35" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="90.00000000000003" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-33" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-35" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="90" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-34" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Surviving physical evidence that is directly linked to the event must exist and be accessible for testing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Reliable and validated scientific methods, like radiocarbon dating or textual analysis, must be applicable and accurately applied.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There must be an unbroken chain of custody for the evidence to ensure its integrity from the moment of discovery to testing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The conclusions must be corroborated by independent sources or labs to minimize the risk of misinterpretation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Non-physical or intangible aspects of an event, such as thoughts, motivations, or spiritual claims that leave no material traces.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Not Authentic&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Methodological Errors&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Flawed techniques, contamination of samples, or outdated calibration can lead to inaccurate results.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Interpretation Bias&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The scientists&#39; preconceptions or external pressures can skew their analysis of the data.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Forgery or Tampering&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Fabricated evidence or altered samples can produce misleading scientific verification.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Unresolved Grounding&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without scientific verification, claims about physical events may lack a firm grounding in empirical reality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Methodological Errors&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Review the testing protocols, lab accreditations, and any replication studies to check for flaws.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Interpretation Bias&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Examine the scientists&#39; affiliations for potential conflicts of interest and compare their findings with independent analyses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Forgery or Tampering&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Trace the chain of custody for all samples and use forensic markers to test for authenticity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Heighten the scrutiny of written and oral artifacts, checking closely for internal textual consistency and coherence.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Replicate the tests in multiple independent labs to confirm the results and reduce the chance of error.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-reference scientific findings with archaeological alignment and the broader historical context to ensure there are no anachronisms or inconsistencies.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Integrate the findings with multiple independent corroborations to challenge biases and expose potential forgeries.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess whether scientific findings are being interpreted neutrally or are being forced to fit pre-existing religious beliefs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-33" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="405" height="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-10" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="175" y="420" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-11" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Iterative Verification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#996185;fontSize=8;fillColor=#E6D0DE;gradientColor=#D5739D;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-10" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="90.00000000000003" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-12" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-10" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="90" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-13" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Knowledge is provisional and must be open to revision in light of new, relevant evidence from any field (e.g., science, history, philosophy).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A true claim will not only withstand new evidence but should actually be reinforced by it, its explanatory power necessarily growing over time.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The process requires intellectual humility and a commitment to truth over wishful thinking and ignorance.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Conclusions must be corroborated by independent iterations to minimize error.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- A final, unchanging conclusion: verification is an ongoing process of refinement, not a one-time event that ends in absolute certainty.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Note that, if your claim is on the Truth, then the &quot;changing conclusions&quot; will be more and more non-fundamental with more iterations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Arrogant, Stubborn, or Wishful Thinking&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- New evidence that contradicts the claim is ignored, denied, or explained away with ad hoc rationalizations to protect the belief from being falsified.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The belief becomes a closed, non-falsifiable system - thus indistinguishable from a false belief.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Incoherent Patchwork&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- New evidence is haphazardly integrated without ensuring it is consistent with the system&#39;s core axioms, resulting in a belief system that becomes increasingly contradictory over time.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Blind Faith&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without continually grounding beliefs in reality, then the claim becomes indistinguishable from false claims that initially appear true but can eventually be discovered to be false.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Arrogant, Stubborn, or Wishful Thinking&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Look for a pattern of dismissing or reinterpreting contradictory evidence rather than engaging with it honestly.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Check if the system has fundamentally changed or adapted in response to major scientific or philosophical discoveries.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Incoherent Patchwork&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Test if recent additions or &quot;updates&quot; to the belief system are consistent with its foundational, non-negotiable axioms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim requires blind faith to be considered true, as it is impossible to establish confidence in its reliability over time.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Actively seek new knowledge from relevant fields and test its compatibility with the claim.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A claim demonstrates strong iterative verification if new discoveries fit naturally into its framework and are better explained by it than by competing theories.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-12" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="505" height="335" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="R9KsqkVaDdQRdcibOEgs-0" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="575" y="360" width="100" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-33" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resistance to Fabrication&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#8381BF;fontSize=8;fillColor=#DCDBFC;gradientColor=#9393E0;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="R9KsqkVaDdQRdcibOEgs-0" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="100" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-29" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="R9KsqkVaDdQRdcibOEgs-0" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="100" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-30" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Every source has the potential to be fabricated, as human beings can manipulate information for personal gain.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The sources should resist common political, religious, or personal motives that might lead to distorting, inventing, or exaggerating details.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Claims that are embarrassing, counterproductive, or contrary to the source&#39;s known interests have a reduced risk of being fabricated...&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- ... While they also possess a higher risk of being fabricated specifically for attention.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There must be accessibility to contextual evidence, allowing scholars to evaluate the potential biases or motives behind a source.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The internal thoughts or unexpressed motives of the source’s author.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Events or details that were not recorded (even if they were authentic), as they were not relevant to the source&#39;s purpose.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Absolute certainty of neutrality, as all sources may carry subtle or unconscious biases.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Not Authentic&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Hidden Agendas&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Undetected motives can lead to fabricated or heavily skewed accounts that appear genuine.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;False Neutrality&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Sources can appear to be unbiased but may subtly promote an agenda, which inflates their perceived reliability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Selective Reporting&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The omission of inconvenient details and the insertion of manipulated ones can create a misleading narrative.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Increased Fabrication Risk&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A lack of resistance to fabrication in a source weakens the trustworthiness of other nodes in the evaluation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Over-Reliance on Biased Sources&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Depending on agenda-driven records reduces the overall reliability of the transmission.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Unchallenged Narratives&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Single-perspective accounts can dominate the historical record without any checks for motive-driven alterations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Hidden Agendas&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Analyze the source’s historical and cultural context to identify potential motives for fabrication.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;False Neutrality&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-check for the criterion of embarrassment or dissimilarity to detect subtle biases in a seemingly neutral account.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Selective Reporting&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Compare the account with diverse, independent sources to identify significant omissions or inconsistencies.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If it is significant to the claim that it&#39;s distinguishable from falsehood, yet it possesses a weak resistance to fabrication, then its logical resistance to fabrication must be more heavily scrutinized.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-reference the account with multiple independent corroborations to confirm details against sources that are likely free of the same agenda.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Use consistency with the broader context to rule out any motive-driven anachronisms or exaggerations&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Apply scientific verification, like dating artifacts or stylistic analysis of texts, to support or challenge the source’s claims.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the corroborated claims through the religious context to verify their historical authenticity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-29" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="435" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-65" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="225" y="360" width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-60" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Absence of Alternate Explanations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#8381BF;fontSize=8;fillColor=#DCDBFC;gradientColor=#9393E0;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-65" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-61" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-65" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="120" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-62" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The claim must be the best-fit explanation, superior to alternatives in parsimony and explanatory power.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- It must be compared against other plausible, competing hypotheses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The best explanation is the one that accounts for the most data with the fewest unsupported assumptions (Occam&#39;s razor).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The evaluation must be fair and apply the same standards of evidence and logic to all competing explanations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim&#39;s uniqueness (in its alignment with the Truth) must be demonstrable through comparison.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Otherwise, no distinguishing between truth and falsehood will ever occur.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Your own ignorance: this method can only identify the best explanation among the currently known and formulated options.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- But, arguments from ignorance are still invalid: speculation is not refutation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The absence of known alternate explanations is the goal, not absence of all speculative alternate explanations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Equally parsimonious explanations without decisive differentiators.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Confirmation Bias&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A preferred explanation is favored (due to bias) despite a simpler or more powerful alternative being available because the alternative is less comfortable or familiar.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;False Dilemma&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The choice is presented as being between the proposed claim and only one, often weak, alternative, when in fact other, stronger possibilities exist (that are simply unknown out of ignorance).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Premature Conclusion&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without a thorough comparison to alternatives, a belief is adopted prematurely and lacks full justification&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A claim&#39;s justification comes not only from its internal logic but also from its demonstrated superiority over competing explanations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- It might be a plausible explanation, but there would be no way to know if it is the best explanation, leaving the belief grounded in incomplete analysis rather than comparative evaluation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Confirmation Bias&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Actively &quot;steelman&quot; competing hypotheses, articulating them in their most persuasive forms before comparing them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If the best form of a competing argument can be refuted, then the claim must be stronger than the objection.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;False Dilemma&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Learn and discover all plausible alternatives rather than simply accepting the options presented.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim requires blind faith to be considered true, as it is impossible to actually know its reliability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Systematically compare the competing explanations using abductive reasoning:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Which one explains the most evidence (ie. corresponds with reality the most)?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Which one requires the fewest unsupported assumptions (to converge on the one without any)?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-61" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="540" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-15" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Robustness to Objections&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#8381BF;fontSize=8;fillColor=#DCDBFC;gradientColor=#9393E0;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="105" y="360" width="110" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-16" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="105" y="380" width="110" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="105" y="380" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-17" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- A true logical claim must be able to withstand rigorous scrutiny, novel objections, and false counterarguments.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- All false claims necessarily contradict with reality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- As such, even if false claims appear stronger at first, over time the true claim necessarily will correspond with reality stronger.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The process must involve engaging with the strongest possible versions of objections (steelmanning), not weak or misrepresented versions (strawmanning).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Both the objections and their responses must adhere to the same standards of logical rigor as the original claim.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The sincerity or motivations of the one making the objections.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Irrelevant or fallacious objections not grounded in logic.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Evasive Defense&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Objections are dismissed superficially (from using invalid reasoning) rather than refuted.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Strawmanning&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Weakening objections by presenting them in a different (but easier way to address) makes the claim appear stronger.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Ad Hoc Rescue&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The original claim is modified with novel, speculative, or unsupported exceptions solely to evade an objection.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This makes an argument from ignorance, allowing for the defense of any false claim.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Brittle Belief&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without being tested against objections, a belief remains unverified and vulnerable.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- It becomes impossible to distinguish it from the countless falsehoods that also lack a robust defense.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Relying on the luck of holding an untested belief is not a methodology for seeking truth - it&#39;s a passive stance that leaves one susceptible to error.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This prevents you from confidently knowing if the claim is wrong or not, as it can&#39;t be verified as the &quot;best&quot; option if it is never compared with others.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Evasive Defense&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Analyze the responses to objections: are they grounded in evidence, or do they rely on logical fallacies?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Strawmanning&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &quot;Steelman&quot; objections instead: present them in their strongest form, then refute them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The Truth will never contradict reality, so presenting a false claim in its strongest form will only establish its own falsehood.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Ad Hoc Rescue&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Check if the &quot;solution&quot; to an objection is a principled extension of the system&#39;s core axioms, or if it is an arbitrary patch with no other justification.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim requires blind faith to be considered true, as you&#39;re trusting factors beyond your control for why you&#39;re on the true belief (rather than learning about reality in order to to distinguish between truth and falsehood).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Actively seek out the most powerful and well-reasoned objections from opposing viewpoints.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A claim demonstrates robustness if it can either (a) logically refute the objection or (b) integrate the objection&#39;s valid points in a way that strengthens the original claim&#39;s coherence and explanatory scope.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="510" height="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-36" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="570" y="300" width="110" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-38" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consistency with Broader Context&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontSize=8;fillColor=#DAE8FC;gradientColor=#7EA6E0;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-36" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="110.00000000000003" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-31" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-36" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="110" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-32" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;An established baseline of verified historical, cultural, and scientific knowledge must exist for comparison.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The details of the event must be specific enough to be tested against this broader context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The contextual knowledge used for comparison must be comprehensive and up-to-date, incorporating recent scholarship and discoveries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;A neutral evaluation framework must be used, to avoid forcing the evidence to fit the context through selective interpretation while also avoiding hyper-skepticism.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Unique or unprecedented aspects of the event that are not covered by existing knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Subjective experiences or interpretations that are not tied to verifiable, external facts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Not Authentic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Forced Alignment&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Selectively choosing or misinterpreting the historical context can create a false consistency that masks a fabrication.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Modern biases can project contemporary knowledge backward, which distorts the historical fit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Anachronistic Insertion&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The degradation of language over time or simple mistranslation can obscure the original meaning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Incomplete Context Exploitation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Gaps in what is known about a historical period can allow unsubstantiated claims to appear consistent.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Missing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Isolated Event Risk&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;An event might seem plausible in a vacuum but could contradict wider historical patterns, leading to the acceptance of anomalies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Contextual Blind Spots&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Overlooking cultural or scientific improbabilities can incorrectly inflate an event&#39;s credibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Risk Identification&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Forced Alignment&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Compare the event&#39;s details against multiple, diverse contextual sources to detect any cherry-picking of evidence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Anachronistic Insertion&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Cross-check timelines, language, and artifacts to ensure they are accurate for the specific period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Incomplete Context Exploitation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Provisionally accept or reject claims based on the level of confidence in the overarching context (subject to later revision as more is learned)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Scrutinize the chain of transmission more cautiously for signs of potential fabrication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Verifying Authenticity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Align the event with parallel historical records, archaeological data, and scientific principles to confirm that it fits the broader context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Continually update the context with new discoveries to refine the assessment of consistency over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the corroborated claims through the religious context to verify their historical authenticity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-31" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="360" height="435" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-19" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Coherence and Internal Consistency&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontSize=8;fillColor=#DAE8FC;gradientColor=#7EA6E0;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="155" y="300" width="130" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-20" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="155" y="320" width="130" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="155" y="320" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-21" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The claim, its premises, axioms, and all related conclusions within the belief system must be free of logical contradictions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Law of Non-Contradiction: a concept cannot be both &quot;something&quot; and &quot;not something&quot; at the same time and in the same respect.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The definitions of terms must remain consistent throughout the entire system.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Mysteries or paradoxes that arise from the limits of human comprehension, which are different from logical contradictions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Mysteries/paradoxes fundamentally reduce to ignorance or lack of comprehension, while contradictions reduce to inconsistency with reality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Broader contextual fit beyond the argument&#39;s internal scope.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Self-Refutation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The system contains explicit or implicit contradictions, meaning it asserts somewhere that something is both true and false.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- From a contradiction, anything (true or false) can be proven, rendering the system logically useless.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Equivocation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Terms are used with different meanings in different parts of the system, creating hidden contradictions that mask the system&#39;s incoherence.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Fragmented Beliefs&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The system would be just a collection of unrelated or conflicting assertions without logical integrity, not a unified, coherent worldview.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Self-Refutation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Juxtapose core claims of the system to check for direct contradictions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; For example, if a system claims that there exists a square triangle, then it would be internally inconsistent (as the fundamental distinguishing property between squares and triangles is their number of sides, so there can&#39;t be a shape with both sides of what is being distinguished).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Equivocation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Track the definition of key terms throughout the system to ensure they are used consistently, without being taken out of their original contexts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim requires blind faith to be considered true, as anything can be true if it doesn&#39;t have to be consistent with anything else.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Conduct stress tests by applying the system&#39;s principles to new scenarios to see if they generate contradictions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Be able to clearly distinguish between a mystery/paradox and a contradiction.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Otherwise, you will be unable to fundamentally distinguish between true and false claims.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A sound system can contain mysteries, but it cannot contain contradictions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-20" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="475" height="345" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-38" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="570" y="240" width="110" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-28" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Unbroken Chain of Transmission&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#82B366;fontSize=8;fillColor=#D5E8D4;gradientColor=#97D077;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-38" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="110.00000000000003" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-27" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-38" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="110" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-28" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The evidence has been continuously documented from its origin to the present without any significant gaps in the record.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The custodians of the evidence have maintained accurate records of its handling, transfers, and storage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The methods of transmission have preserved the integrity of the evidence, which requires:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- physical protection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- accurate copying&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- detailed logs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The custodians have been trustworthy and resisted any incentives for tampering with the evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The chain must be accessible for verification, allowing scholars to reconstruct and trace its history.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The overall strength of the chain is defined by its weakest link.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The accuracy of the content if it was altered or incorrect before the chain of transmission began.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Interpretive changes that occur over time without altering the physical artifact or document itself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The hidden motives of the custodians who preserved the evidence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Not Authentic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Alteration&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Undetected changes, such as editing or forgery, can introduce errors into the evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Untrustworthy Custodians&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Deliberate or negligent manipulation by handlers can skew the evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Loss of Integrity&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Weak links, gaps in the chain, environmental damage, or poor handling can compromise the evidence without detection.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Missing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Provenance Doubts&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Without a clear chain of custody, the authenticity of the sources becomes questionable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Speculative Transmission&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Gaps in the record allow for assumptions about how the evidence was handled, which risks accepting a fabrication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Over-Reliance on Fragmented Evidence&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;This increases vulnerability to bias or incomplete narratives from other sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Risk Identification&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Alteration&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Examine the physical or digital artifacts for inconsistencies that could indicate tampering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Untrustworthy Custodians&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- C&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;ross-check custody logs against independent historical records of the institutions or handlers involved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Loss of Integrity&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Assess the evidence for signs of degradation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- C&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;ompare different versions across various branches of transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Identify gaps through chronological analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;ssess corroborative evidence from diverse sources to bridge them cautiously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Verifying Authenticity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Trace the chain backward using archival records, comparing multiple copies or versions to check for fidelity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Integrate scientific verification methods (like carbon dating or stylistic analysis) to build confidence that no anachronistic alterations were made.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Cross-reference with multiple independent corroborations to expose any breaks or inconsistencies in the chain of transmission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the corroborated claims through the religious context to verify their historical authenticity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-27" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="385" height="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-58" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="240" width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-23" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Premises Grounded&lt;br&gt;in Axioms&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#82B366;fontSize=8;fillColor=#D5E8D4;gradientColor=#97D077;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-58" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-24" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-58" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="120" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-25" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Every premise used in the argument must either be a foundational axiom or be logically derived from one.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The chain of derivation from axiom to premise must be explicit and follow valid rules of inference.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There should be no &quot;hidden&quot; premises, leaps, or unstated assumptions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Empirical details requiring external evidence beyond the scope of the axioms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Probabilistic elements if axioms are purely deterministic.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Subjective interpretations not derivable from the axioms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Unsupported Premise&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A premise is asserted as if it were self-evident but is neither a foundational axiom nor derived from one.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This creates a weak link that could invalidate the entire argument.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Logical Leaps&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The stated derivation of a premise from an axiom does not actually follow logically, even if strongly asserted.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Inconsistent Application&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Premises could selectively apply axioms, leading to bias.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Premises may stretch axioms beyond their grounded scope.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Incoherent Argument&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The argument jumps from axioms to a conclusion without the necessary intermediate premises to form a valid bridge.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This allows false claims to appear valid, as they fundamentally require a logical gap in order to jump from a true premise to a false conclusion.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without grounding, false premises become vulnerable to ad hoc justifications, as they can now be molded to resist any objection.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Unsupported Premise&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; For every premise, ask: &quot;Is this an axiom, or how was it derived?&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Challenge any premise that cannot be traced back to the foundational axioms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Logical Leaps&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Explicitly map out the deductive or inductive steps from the axiom to the premise to ensure the connection is valid.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Inconsistent Application&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Check for uniform use of axioms across all premises.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Limit premises to direct implications of axioms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim requires blind faith to be considered true, as it is impossible to rationally defend the claim.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Create a logical flowchart that traces each premise back to its foundational axioms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Articulate any implicit assumptions to turn them into explicit premises that can then be evaluated.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-24" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="475" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-39" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="180" width="130" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-21" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Multiple Independent Corroborations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=8;fillColor=#FFF2CC;gradientColor=#FFD966;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-39" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="130" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-25" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-39" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="130" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-26" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The sources must be truly independent (ie. without common origins or influencing one another).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There must be a sufficient number of sources to ensure statistical reliability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The sources must agree on the fundamental details of the event.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Fundamental alignment, even with differences in secondary details, supports a reliable source.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Diversity in the types of sources support greater historical coverage and reliability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The sources should be minimally influenced by overarching political or cultural pressures that could have skewed their accounts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The internal thoughts of the authors or witnesses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Unobservant processes that occurred during or after the testimony&#39;s recording.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Non-existent sources that may have been filtered, censored, or destroyed over time.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Not Authentic&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Echo Chamber&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Sources that seem independent are actually dependent on each other, falsely inflating the event&#39;s reliability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Bias Propagation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A shared agenda across multiple sources can skew the consensus and make a biased account seem objective.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Single Source Vulnerability&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Relying on only one account makes the claim highly vulnerable to fabrication or an honest error.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Incomplete Picture&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A lack of diverse sources can obscure alternative perspectives, leading to a one-sided understanding of the event.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Echo Chamber&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Trace the origins and transmission paths of each source to confirm that they are truly independent.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Bias Propagation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the historical and cultural contexts of the sources to identify any shared motives or agendas.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Scrutinize the single source heavily for internal bias and distortion.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Seek consistency with the broader historical context.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-reference all sources (written, oral, and archaeological) with each other to confirm the core facts of the event.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure the corroborated details are consistent with the broader historical context to rule out anachronisms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Greater diversity in the sources provides better historical coverage while simultaneously challenging potential biases.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the corroborated claims through the religious context to verify their historical authenticity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-25" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="405" height="385" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-27" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Axioms Grounded&lt;br&gt;in Reality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=8;fillColor=#FFF2CC;gradientColor=#FFD966;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="180" width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-28" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="200" width="120" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="160" y="200" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-29" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The argument&#39;s foundational starting points (ie. axioms) must correspond to universal, empirical observations or self-evident truths.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This is opposed to speculation, or arguments from ignorance.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Axioms must be fundamental, verifiable through repeated observation, and not themselves require proof within the logical system.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- They must be mutually consistent and not contradict one another.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Abstract hypotheticals or unobservable realms without empirical ties.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Axioms cannot be &quot;proven&quot; by the argument that rests upon them: their validity must be established externally.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- In other words, axioms are directly observed or inferred: they are &quot;proven&quot; by proving the system&#39;s internal and external consistency.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Ungrounded Abstractions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The axioms are based on speculation, feelings, or cultural tradition rather than objective reality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Even if the entire logical structure is entirely valid, following those axioms, the conclusions would be disconnected from the truth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Contradictory Foundations&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The axioms conflict with each other, making any sound conclusion impossible and guaranteeing the incoherency of the system.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Overgeneralization and Hidden Assumptions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Axioms drawn from limited observations may not hold universally, causing false inferences.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- As such, unstated premises may sneak in, undermining the grounding.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Infinite Regress&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The argument lacks a solid starting point - meaning that all premises lack fundamental context.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Every premise would require another premise to support it, leading to an endless chain of justifications with no foundation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Ungrounded Abstractions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Test each axiom against the foundational inferences derived from reality, detecting unverified assumptions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Contradictory Foundations&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Place the axioms side-by-side and examine if they can all be true simultaneously, rejecting any that contradict consistent observation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Overgeneralization and Hidden Assumptions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Explicitly list all axioms and check for implicit ones.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Verify axioms across diverse contexts to ensure universality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- I&lt;i&gt;f Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim fundamentally requires blind faith to be considered true, as it can never be fully grounded in reality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without grounding in reality, nothing could be considered &quot;true&quot; as all axioms would have equal weight, thus making it impossible to distinguish between &quot;true&quot; and &quot;false&quot; axioms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure each axiom is a genuine first principle - a statement so fundamental that rejecting it would make further reasoning impossible.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure axioms align with established inferences from reality to rule out speculation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Confirm that the axioms are sufficient to support the rest of the argument without needing to introduce hidden assumptions later.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-28" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="450" height="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-17" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="455" y="120" width="100" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-14" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Oral Eyewitness Testimony&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#D69555;fontSize=8;fillColor=#FFDEC9;gradientColor=#FFB663;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-17" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="100" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-15" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-17" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="100" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Witnesses were present.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Witness accurately perceived the event, with:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- direct, first-hand perception&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- good faith&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- sound mind and memory&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- accurate communication&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Cultural context supports reliable oral traditions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There should be access to the witnesses for direct recounting and verification of their testimony.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Internal motivations of witnesses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Events beyond the witnesses&#39; direct sensory experience.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Quantitative data requiring measurement for verification.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Not Authentic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Distortion&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Faulty memory, bad faith, or mental impairment can lead to inaccurate accounts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Fabrication and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Exaggeration&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Witnesses can embellish events, which leads to false or exaggerated details being passed on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Cultural Misalignment&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Oral traditions become weaker if the cultural practices of a society do not support accuracy.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Missing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Over-Reliance on Secondary Sources&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Dependence on later writings increases risk of editorial bias or loss of important nuance.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Risk Identification&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Distortion&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Check for inconsistencies in the testimony and evaluate potential bias by examining the historical context.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Fabrication and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Exaggeration&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess if the testimony is dissimilar from known facts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure testimony is coherent with the witness&#39; known actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Check for absence (or mitigation) of self-serving motives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Cultural Misalignment&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Study the culture to see if it supports the accurate transmission of oral history.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Scrutinize any written evidence more heavily for potential editorial bias.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Verifying Authenticity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-reference oral accounts with written testimony and archaeological evidence to reduce distortion.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure consistency with broader context to rule out anachronisms (details that don&#39;t fit the time period).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Corroborating independent oral and written accounts mitigate exaggeration and expose distortion.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the content of the testimony to verify alignment with religious beliefs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-15" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="365" height="415" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-18" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="565" y="120" width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-10" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Written Eyewitness Testimony&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#D69555;fontSize=8;fillColor=#FFDEC9;gradientColor=#FFB663;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-18" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-3" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-18" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="120" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;The a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;uthor was an eyewitness with education, resources, and literacy to record promptly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The document has been preserved in its original form or through verifiably accurate copies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The language and script of the document are decipherable and can be reliably translated without significant loss of meaning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Non-verbal elements of an event, like tone of voice or gestures (unless they are explicitly described in the text).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Any events that were not directly witnessed by the author.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The scientific causality behind an event, as the author would not have had modern empirical tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Perspectives from non-eyewitnesses (who are not the author).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Not Authentic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Forgery or Interpolation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The document could have been written by a non-eyewitness or a false name.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Later edits could have introduced false information to push an agenda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Translation Errors&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The degradation of language over time or simple mistranslation can obscure the original meaning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Bias&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The author&#39;s personal agenda (whether religious, political, good or bad faith) could have skewed the facts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Missing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Over-reliance on Oral Testimony or Archaeology&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Relying only on memory or artifacts risks creating gaps in the narrative&#39;s detail or leading to misinterpretation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Lack of a Fixed Reference&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Without a written record, oral traditions may change over time, and artifacts may lack the textual context needed for proper interpretation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Risk Identification&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Forgery&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-reference different textual variants and the manuscript&#39;s history to detect edits.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Check the author&#39;s claims against the historical context.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Bias&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the document for dissimilarity to known facts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure testimony is coherent with the author&#39;s known actions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Check for absence (or mitigation) of self-serving motives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Translation Errors&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Study the culture to ensure support for textual accuracy.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- E&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;nlist experts for precise translations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Scrutinize oral accounts more heavily for corroboration and potential distortion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Verifying Authenticity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-reference the written testimony with oral accounts and archaeological evidence to reduce distortion and confirm details.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure the account is consistent with the broader historical context to rule out anachronisms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Corroborating the account with independent oral and written sources helps mitigate exaggeration and expose distortion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess the content of the testimony to verify alignment with religious beliefs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="395" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-40" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="695" y="120" width="100" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-7" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Archaeological Alignment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#D69555;fontSize=8;fillColor=#FFDEC9;gradientColor=#FFB663;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-40" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="100" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-8" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-40" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="100" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The artifacts or sites discovered must be directly tied to the event.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The excavation methods used to uncover the artifacts must have been rigorous and uncontaminated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The interpretation of the artifacts must align with historical records without forcing the evidence to fit a preconceived narrative.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;There must be comparative artifacts available from the same period to provide context for the analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Abstract ideas, beliefs, or spoken words, as these do not leave a physical trace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The identities or motivations of individuals, unless inscriptions are present.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Transient events, such as speeches, that do not leave behind physical evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;The emotional or psychological states of the people involved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Not Authentic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Misinterpretation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Incorrectly dating an artifact or taking it out of context can lead to false conclusions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Contamination or Fraud&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Poor excavation practices or faked artifacts can distort the evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Overreach&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- It is possible to assign undue significance to ambiguous findings that don&#39;t clearly support a specific claim.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Missing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Lack of Tangible Proof&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Relying solely on texts or oral accounts risks ungrounded speculation about what actually happened.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Weakened Validation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Without physical evidence, historical narratives lack objective corroboration and are harder to prove.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Risk Identification&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Misinterpretation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Verify dating with independently corroborated methods, like radiocarbon dating and stratigraphy.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-check interpretations with textual records.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Contamination or Fraud&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Assess the excavation protocols and the artifact&#39;s provenance (its chain of custody and origin)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Overreach&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Ensure that interpretations align with minimal assumptions by using comparative artifacts and anthropological knowledge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Scrutinize oral and written accounts more heavily for corroboration and distortion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Seek indirect archaeological evidence that may be related.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Verifying Authenticity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cross-reference artifacts with oral and written testimony to confirm details within the broader historical context.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure consistency with the broader context to rule out anachronisms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Corroborate findings with independent archaeological discoveries to mitigate misinterpretation and fraud.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; If Religious Beliefs are Already Established&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Assess archaeological finds through the religious context to verify the historical authenticity of related claims.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-8" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="375" height="425" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-56" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="95" y="120" width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-31" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Possesses Logical Structure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#D69555;fontSize=8;fillColor=#FFDEC9;gradientColor=#FFB663;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-56" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-32" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-56" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="120" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-33" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The claim is presented as a structured argument (premises leading to a conclusion).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- All premises must be explicitly stated, with no hidden assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The argument corresponds with reality such that it is externally consistent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The argument must follow established rules of logic (ex. inductive, deductive) such that it is internally consistent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The claim can&#39;t speak to a context beyond what the premises necessarily encompass.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- No valid argument can justify an internal contradiction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- No sound argument can justify an external contradiction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Formal and Informal Fallacies&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The argument&#39;s structure is flawed, meaning that the conclusion does not necessarily follow from the premises.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The reasoning is flawed due to irrelevant information, emotional appeals, or other rhetorical tricks that persuasively make a false claim appear sound.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Oversimplification&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Complexity may be reduced to overly rigid structures, ignoring nuances that lead to misleading deductions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Equivocation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Terms may shift meanings across premises in order to resolve arising contradictions, creating an illusion of validity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Ungrounded Assertion&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim becomes a mere statement without justification, making it impossible to evaluate (as &quot;true&quot; or &quot;false&quot;) or distinguish from opinion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without a clear structure, evaluation defaults to subjective feelings, increasing vulnerability to bias.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This makes it impossible to evaluate the claim rationally, as it necessarily reduces to &quot;it&#39;s true because I say so&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The alternative would otherwise have been, &quot;it&#39;s true because of evidence A, B, and C&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Formal and Informal Fallacies&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Identify the structure of the argument to verify soundness and eliminate alternatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Evaluate the relevance of each premise to the conclusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Strip away appeals to emotion, authority, or popularity to see if the evidence still holds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Oversimplification&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Compare the structure to real-world observations to identify ignored variables or assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Equivocation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Define all key terms explicitly at the start and check for consistency throughout.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;If Missing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim either requires blind faith to be considered true, or is simply considered an opinion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Break the argument down into its fundamental premises and conclusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Ensure that each logical step follows valid rules of inference, creating an unbroken chain of reasoning from the premises to the conclusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-32" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="495" height="395" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-57" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="225" y="120" width="126" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-50" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Possesses Objective Source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#D69555;fontSize=8;fillColor=#FFDEC9;gradientColor=#FFB663;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-57" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-51" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-57" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6" y="20" width="120" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6" y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-52" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The source of the claim (ex. a specific text, author, or tradition) must be identifiable and accessible for evaluation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The source must have a basis for its claims, whether through direct observation, logical deduction, or received tradition.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The context of the source (whether historical, cultural, philosophical) must be knowable to assess potential biases.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The source must be reliable and trustworthy, to verify resistance to agenda-driven influences.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Limits (what it can never speak to)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Purely subjective interpretations or personal revelations that lack external corroboration.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The internal motivations or unstated assumptions of the author or tradition.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Invalid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Unreliable Source&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The source is known for bias, frequent errors, or a clear agenda that undermines its credibility.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Misattributed Source&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim is attributed to a respected authority who never actually made it, creating a false appeal to authority.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Contextual Misalignment&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The source may be taken out of its original framework, leading to distorted interpretations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;If Missing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Orphan Assertion&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim has no traceable origin, making it impossible to verify its context, development, or reliability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This makes it indistinguishable from speculation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This significantly weakens the claim, as it could have come from an unreliable source without detection.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mitigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Risk Identification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Unreliable Source&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Investigate the source&#39;s historical track record, known affiliations, and potential motives.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; Compare its claims with those of independent, neutral sources.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Misattributed Source&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Trace the claim back to its earliest known appearance to verify the attribution.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Contextual Misalignment&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Study the full context to ensure the claim aligns with the source&#39;s intended meaning.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If Missing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The claim requires blind faith to be considered true, as its unknown origins makes it indistinguishable from speculation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Verifying Authenticity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Confirm that the source is cited accurately and that the claim is not taken out of context.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Replicate the source&#39;s methodology: does it rely on evidence and reason, or does it appeal to emotion, wishful thinking, fabrication, or unverified authority?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-51" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="400" height="375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-2" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="580" y="60" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Historical Event&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;gradientColor=#ea6b66;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-2" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="90" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-0" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-2" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="90" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The event must be ontologically possible, requiring:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Internally consistent, without contradictions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Externally consistent, corresponding perfectly with what is known about reality.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;It must be epistemologically distinguishable from falsehood (meaning there is a way to determine if it is true or not).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - In other words, it must have had the potential to generate evidence, plausibly leaving behind traces that can be discovered.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- F&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;abricated claims necessarily contain logical contradictions with reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;As such, there must be some criterion that distinguishes false supernatural events from true ones.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks (if the following procedure isn&#39;t implemented properly)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Fabrication or Mythologization&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The event may be a later invention or exaggeration&amp;nbsp;of what actually happened.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Misattribution&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The event could be incorrectly dated, located, or attributed to the wrong people.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Anachronistic Projection&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Details may be retroactively added that don’t align with the original event.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="O7Ek6xn6U8omZZuawULH-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="310" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-47" value="" style="group" parent="hWMIEFPYRjVYOYn_n3Nj-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="135" y="60" width="170" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-43" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Philosophical/Religious Claim&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;comic=0;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;gradientColor=#ea6b66;arcSize=50;treeMoving=1;treeFolding=0;strokeWidth=0.5;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-47" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry width="170" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-44" value="" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFD966;swimlaneFillColor=#E6E6E6;connectable=1;allowArrows=0;treeFolding=0;treeMoving=1;expand=0;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-47" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry y="20" width="170" height="5" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle y="20" width="50.00000000000001" height="3.333333333333333" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-45" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;Assumptions/Requirements (for value)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The claim must have a clear and precise definition, with unambiguous terms, such that it can be evaluated as &quot;true&quot; or &quot;false&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- It must be presented as coherent and free of contradictions, so it can be distinguished from a falsehood.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- It must be substantive (ie. not tautological) and claim to be grounded in reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The True religion should become more - not less - plausible as human knowledge expands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- It must correspond with all of reality, so it should not fear new discoveries but should be able to integrate them seamlessly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Risks (if the following procedure isn&#39;t implemented properly)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Vacuity or Triviality&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A claim without substance provides nothing concrete to test or defend.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A claim that can&#39;t be assigned as &quot;true&quot; or &quot;false&quot; falls beyond the scope of reason.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without a clear claim, the entire process of evaluation cannot begin - leaving only un-testable opinions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Ambiguity Leading to Equivocation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If terms are vague, then arguments can shift in meaning to explain apparent contradictions, rendering logical evaluation impossible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Evidence may be force-fitted to align with a belief, leading to premature commitment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;i&gt;Misalignment with Framework&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; The claim may not fit the philosophical or religious tradition it claims to represent, risking internal contradictions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" parent="Cbk4jdbypY1MTeg349pZ-44" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="15" width="400" height="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="4. Defining God" id="aANHenpsSWRYgS43lxqr">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1726" dy="1035" grid="1" gridSize="5" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="#CCCCCC" math="0" shadow="0" adaptiveColors="none">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="mIenp-yJnPnNglZ723Zf-0" />
        <mxCell id="mIenp-yJnPnNglZ723Zf-1" parent="mIenp-yJnPnNglZ723Zf-0" />
        <mxCell id="KY1FcD49Ovdj6-WkPWFB-0" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Summary of Secondary Conclusions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; font-size: 4px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=11;strokeWidth=2;" parent="mIenp-yJnPnNglZ723Zf-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="580" width="810" height="505" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KY1FcD49Ovdj6-WkPWFB-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;God possesses power and intelligence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;that encompasses all of reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God is all-powerful.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God is all-knowing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God created all things.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;God transcends time and space.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;God is atemporal/eternal: experiencing no past, present, or future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God is aspatial/immaterial: not being composed, caused, or governed by physical processes.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God is uncaused.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God is limitless/infinite.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;God wanted the universe to be created exactly as it is.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Destruction is an easier task than creation and maintaining order.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;could have more easily destroyed this universe than to have created it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God is not surprised by what He creates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;God intentionally created us with a purpose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;God is consistent.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;God doesn&#39;t change His mind, in the sense of learning of a better approach to something.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Reality does not contain contradictions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;God&#39;s will is the fundamental material of reality.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;The universe&#39;s existence is not a one-time event, but a continuous processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;eality is not self-sustaining or accidental.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The consistent laws of nature we observe are a direct reflection of God&#39;s unchanging will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The dependence of reality on God&#39;s will is why we can&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;infer His necessary properties from its structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;6.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;God is intentionally subtle.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;God is discoverable by reason.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;God has complete power over us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Truth and proper reason correspond with God&#39;s will.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;To implement proper reasoning is to align our minds with His will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;To understand a truth is to understand an aspect of God&#39;s sustained, willed expression.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Rationalizing falsehood is an act that does not correspond with God&#39;s will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;God is not the author of confusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;God gave us a will to choose the values that govern how we live our lives.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;God allows us to pursue good or evil as we wish.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;allows us the capacity to pursue falsehood if we choose to use our reason improperly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Our wills &quot;seek permission&quot; from God to manifest in reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Our wills are distinct from God (ie. still contingent) and from temporal reality (ie. are atemporal).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The causal relationship between God&#39;s will and ours is a paradox as we can&#39;t comprehend atemporality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Destiny and predestiny refer to the same concept, differing only on temporal/atemporal perspective.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" parent="mIenp-yJnPnNglZ723Zf-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="625" width="385" height="455" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KY1FcD49Ovdj6-WkPWFB-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;9. Any True religion corresponds to the purpose that God created us for.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God has an ontological will and a prescriptive will.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God wants us to freely pursue the Truth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Proper reason filters out falsehood and converges towards the true understanding of reality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Some decisions are objectively better than others.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Only one set of fundamental claims corresponds to the singular, consistent reality of God&#39;s will.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A &quot;religion&quot; is a way of life that is governed by a set of beliefs and values.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A &quot;True religion&quot; prescribes the way of life that achieves our God-given purpose.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Any True religion will be fundamentally founded on using proper reason to believe in God.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The True religion transcends comfort and culture, guiding towards truth and what is right.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &quot;Faith&quot; is a form of reason in which the foundational premise relies on trustworthiness or knowledge rather than empirical observation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A religion that fundamentally reduces to a leap of faith against/without reason has no mechanism to distinguish itself from a well-crafted falsehood that appeals to the same emotions or desires.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Reality corresponds more closely with a test than a punishment.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;10. The True religion corresponds with reality.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- An exception doesn&#39;t disprove the rule; it highlights the existence of a &quot;higher&quot; law that encompasses both.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A &quot;miracle&quot; is, fundamentally, a unique phenomenon that contradicts human capacity to replicate it.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- True miracles must be distinguishable from false (manmade, deceptive) miracles.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A mystery is a paradoxical gap in our knowledge that is beyond our limited human comprehension.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- A contradiction is where the distinguishable difference between two things is also shared by them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Both mysteries and contradictions appear as profoundly deep concepts, yet are distinguishable on their correspondence with reality.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Mysteries cause reflection on our own limits, relative to God&#39;s ultimate power and transcendence.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Contradictions require infinite justifications, fundamentally appealing to emotion instead of proper reason.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The True religion does not demand belief in contradictions.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If a religion has no distinguishing factor between mysteries and contradictions, then it is fundamentally indistinguishable from a false religion (as falsehoods now can be portrayed as mysteries without detection).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Subjectivity is a product of imperfect perception, not reality itself.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;11. The True religion is distinguishable from false religions.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- We can use tools like source, logical, and empirical evaluation to filter the True religion from the false one.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Humble, iterative reasoning necessarily converges on the Truth, allowing discoverability without coercion.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The consistency of the True religion necessarily reflects God&#39;s consistency when it comes to Truth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- False religions will inevitably contradict reality at a fundamental level.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Faith is blind when reason isn&#39;t used to verify the source&#39;s trustworthiness and reliability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God tests us (in the pursuit of Truth) by means of others (how they treat us).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;12. The True religion is accessible to everyone (whether they seek it or not).&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The True religion must be founded on principles that transcend language and culture.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The primary &quot;scripture&quot; of the True religion is embedded in reality itself: universally discoverable and attainable.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Humble, accumulative, iterative reasoning necessarily converges on the Truth while filtering out falsehoods.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- God does not hold us accountable for a capacity that we can&#39;t achieve.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Reason, reflection, and humility are universally available to anyone who is willing to pursue the Truth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" parent="mIenp-yJnPnNglZ723Zf-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="410" y="625" width="415" height="455" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fx626PuUIQLOE6xpVhJy-1" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;rounded=1;jumpSize=6;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;endSize=3;" parent="mIenp-yJnPnNglZ723Zf-1" source="YdMphQ4ud1DiJM4NY9TI-4" target="fJFOEOjyfabwSS2oxoq5-1" edge="1">
