        <mxCell id="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-11" value="" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" parent="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="305" width="810.0000000000001" height="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-12" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Every inference has a limit.&lt;br&gt;+&lt;br&gt;Speculation is neither proof nor refutation.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#D5D5D5;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=none;" parent="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="163" height="175" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="163" height="175" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-13" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maybe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 102);&quot;&gt;If true, then the universe would have to have been fundamentally created by a&lt;br&gt;not-universe, which could have been some multiversal structure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;However, this doesn&#39;t resolve the result of infinite regression, as now the question shifts to what caused the multiverse - without an observed answer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 102);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Also, any explanation for the universe&#39;s origin is speculative, requiring us to infer that &quot;arguments from ignorance are stronger than arguments of best-fit&quot;. However, this would also require the contradiction of &quot;speculation is neither proof nor refutation&quot; - ie. &quot;speculation &lt;b&gt;is&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;refutation&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#FFCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=-2;" parent="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="163" width="161" height="175" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="161" height="175" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-17" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Yes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 153, 153);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 153, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Reality is temporal and contingent, while the gods must be eternal and uncaused.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#FFFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=-2;" parent="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="324" width="163" height="175" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="163" height="175" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-20" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Yes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 153, 153);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 153, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Reality is temporal and contingent, while God must be eternal and uncaused.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=-2;" parent="YZqMC-y3LvAAL2BY0nUx-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="487" width="161" height="175" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="161" height="175" as="alternateBounds" />
