        <mxCell id="h2RVPG1P-ozCtyoppiS8-2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;No&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The universe&#39;s complexity is random, and if &quot;speculation is refutation&quot;, then the multiverse better fits reality than some divine guidance.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#FFCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=-2;" parent="h2RVPG1P-ozCtyoppiS8-0" vertex="1">
