        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-119" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Yes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CBE2FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-116">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="70" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="70" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-120" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-115">
          <mxGeometry y="70" width="810" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-121" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;1. Textual/Historical Claim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 5px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp; What is the claim?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;- Is it ontologically possible and epistemologically attainable?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- What are the criteria for success and failure?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#000000;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#F8CECC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#EA6B66;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-120">
          <mxGeometry width="180" height="95" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="180" height="95" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-122" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The Bible possesses a textual and historical preservation that is superior to all alternatives, which are not authorized by God (ie. deceptive or demonic in origin).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Yes: the claim is both theoretically possible and is able to be known.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Truth is defined/identified by consistency and reality, and falsehood by inconsistency and contradiction with reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-120">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="95" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="95" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-123" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The Quran possesses a preservation and inimitability that is superior to all alternatives, which are not authorized by God (ie. deceptive or demonic in origin).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Yes: the claim is both theoretically possible and is able to be known.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Truth is defined/identified by consistency and reality, and falsehood by inconsistency and contradiction with reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CBE2FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-120">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="95" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="95" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-124" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-115">
          <mxGeometry y="165" width="810" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-125" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Oral, Written, and Archaeological Presence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 5px; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Who were the eyewitnesses, and what did they bear witness to?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- How reliable was the cultural context for preserving oral tradition accurately?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- When was the text written and standardized, and by whom?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- What corroborating archaeological finds are there?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#FFDEC9;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#FFB663;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-124">
          <mxGeometry width="180" height="140" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="180" height="140" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-126" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Three significant events: Jesus&#39; 3-year earthly ministry, 40 days of Jesus&#39; resurrection, and the post-resurrection vision that appeared to Paul.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 1st century context preserved c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;ore concepts without necessary verbatim transmission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The Gospels and Epistles were written by multiple authors (not Jesus) sometime 10-70 years after Jesus&#39; ministry, while the canon was standardized in 382 AD by the Council of Rome.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Archaeology shows s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;trong historical and cultural corroboration, with earliest manuscripts of the New Testament dating to 125 AD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-124">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="140" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="140" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-127" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Two significant events: the Quran&#39;s revelation to the Prophet Muhammad over 23 years, and his character, personality, and ministry in that time period.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 7th century context preserved v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;erbatim with the Quran, semi-verbatim preservation with the Prophet&#39;s life and character.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Three significant events: the writing and ordering of the Quran during the Prophet Muhammad&#39;s life, the first complete written Quran being codified 2 years after his death, and the written standardization of the dialect/accent 20 years after his death.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Archaeology shows o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;verwhelming historical and cultural corroboration, with the earliest manuscripts dating to the Prophet&#39;s life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CBE2FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-124">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="140" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="140" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-128" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-115">
          <mxGeometry y="305" width="810" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-129" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assessment of the Chains of Transmission&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 5px; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How many independent streams of transmission are there, leading to the text&#39;s standardization?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Are there competing claims, and if so, what are their chains of transmission?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What are the strongest, independent chains of custodianship for each stream of transmission?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What are the weakest links in the strongest chains of custodianship?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#FFF2CC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#FFD966;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-128">
          <mxGeometry width="180" height="160" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="180" height="160" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-130" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;3 main streams of transmission (the synoptic, johannine, and pauline chains) that merge with Irenaeus, leading directly to the Council of Rome.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Yes - the Jewish Christians and Gnostics are competing claims to Jesus&#39; message.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Custodianship converges with Irenaeus, Eusebius, and Paul.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;All chains have gaps (either relying on unknown transmission or lost works) - except for the Pauline chain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-128">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="160" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="160" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-131" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;2 main streams of transmission: the Quran and Hadith.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;No competing claims to the Quran&#39;s transmission, while there are competing claims for the transmission of Hadith (Shia vs. Sunni).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Quranic custodianship rests on Uthman, Hafsa, Abu Bakr, and those who memorized it verbatim, while Hadith custodianship converges with the textual compilations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The potential weaknesses of the oral and textual chains are mitigated by the other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CBE2FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-128">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="160" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="160" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-132" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-115">
          <mxGeometry y="465" width="810" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-133" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Alignment with Historical Context&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 5px; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What was the historical context throughout the chain of custodianship?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What were the standards of testimony and custodianship in this time?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Is there anything anachronistic (historically or logically out of place) about the claim or its custodianship?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#D5E8D4;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#97D077;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-132">
          <mxGeometry width="180" height="115" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="180" height="115" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-134" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Three significant time periods: the crucifixion of Jesus, the destruction of the Jerusalem Temple, and the Bar Kokhba revolt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Custodianship started with eyewitness testimony, gradually shifting towards scholarly textual standardization over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Many anachronistic examples against Jewish expectations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-132">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="115" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="115" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-135" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Three significant time periods: the time of Quranic revelation, the time of Quranic textual standardization, and the time of Hadith compilation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Standard custodianship was c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;ommunally verbatim oral transmission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Many anachronistic examples against the 7th century Arabian context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CBE2FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-132">
