        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-137" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Resistance to Fabrication&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 5px; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What possibilities are there for fabrication and error in the claim?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How strongly does the claim resist fabrication and error?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What possibilities are there for fabrication and error with the claim&#39;s custodianship?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How strongly does the claim&#39;s custodianship resist fabrication and error?&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;(Requirements for Trusting Defense)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How strongly does the claim&#39;s custodianship resist fabrication and error?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;(Texts)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How strongly does the claim&#39;s custodianship resist fabrication and error?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Trustworthiness)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#DAE8FC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#7EA6E0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-136">
