        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-138" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Jesus could theoretically be a l&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;iar, lunatic, or be under demonic influence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Jesus&#39;s character assessment strongly resists being a liar, lunatic, or being under demonic influence, but the trinitarian doctrine is weak by logical consistency - which is resolved by faithful history and textual preservation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The custodianship of Jesus&#39; message could have been with b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;ad faith, revisionism, and gradual Christological development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To verify strong custodianship of Jesus&#39; message, Paul&#39;s reliability and alignment with what the earthly Jesus said needs to be i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;ndependently established (before claiming truth).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Gospel custodianship, defending claims, and fabrication/error claims all fundamentally rely on speculation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Deception and/or demonic inspiration are both plausible explanations for Paul&#39;s work, with all defenses requiring retroactive assumptions of truth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-136">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="205" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="205" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-139" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Muhammad could theoretically be a l&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;iar, lunatic, or be under demonic influence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Muhammad&#39;s character assessment strongly resists being a liar, lunatic, or being under demonic influence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The custodianship of the Quran could have been with p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;reservation errors and contextual reinterpretation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To verify strong custodianship of the Quran, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;all plausible natural pathways for fabrication or alteration need to be eliminated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Historical constraints only allow Muhammad as the Quran&#39;s origin, leaving no viable alternative authorship, transmission, or fabrication with its custodianship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;All requirements for Muhammad fabricating the Quran are historically unsupported.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CBE2FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=1;spacingTop=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="jyyV_XFQdHlw1llUxg7D-136">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="205" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="205" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
